:: Dream Modifier Add [nobr]

<<if $DreamLevel == 2>>
	<<addMoodlet "Good Dream" 8>>
<<elseif $DreamLevel == 1>>
	<<addMoodlet "Good Dream" 6>>
<<elseif $DreamLevel == -1>>
	<<addMoodlet "Bad Dream" 6>>
<<elseif $DreamLevel == -2>>
	<<addMoodlet "Nightmare" 8>>
<</if>>
<<set $DreamLevel to 0>>
